---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
search: false
permalink: /
description: "Harvington village website and free weekly newsletter for Harvington, Norton and Lenchwick near Evesham: events, news, regular activities and roadworks."
seoTitle: "Harvington Village Website — events, news and roadworks"
cards:
  - { title: "Events", url: "/events/", icon: calendar, text: "Coming up in the villages and close by." }
  - { title: "News", url: "/notices/", icon: notice, text: "Parish council notices and news from around Harvington." }
  - { title: "Bins", url: "/bins/", icon: bins, text: "Your next collection and which bin takes what." }
---
{#- Harvington's Home (wording approved by Jon 16 Nov 2026). At "/" since launch (stage 7b, 16 Nov), replacing the holding page. Live lines as on the Lenches Home, including the next bin collection. The Facebook card shows once
    site.json has facebookGroup { name, url }. -#}
{%- set nextEvent = (whatson.events | merge(pipeline.events) | upcoming) | first -%}
{%- set allN = pipeline | allNotices(whatson) -%}
{%- set newCount = allN | notRoadItems | newThisWeek -%}
{%- set roads = allN | roadItems | roadSplit -%}
{%- set roadParts = [] -%}
{%- if roads.now | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.now | length) + " on now"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- if roads.soon | length %}{% set roadParts = (roadParts.push((roads.soon | length) + " coming up"), roadParts) %}{% endif -%}
{%- set binLines = [] -%}
{%- for b in bins | nextBins %}{% set binLines = (binLines.push(b.label + ": " + (b.date | shortDate) + ", " + (b.bins | andList)), binLines) %}{% endfor -%}
{%- set live = {
  "/events/": ("Next: " + nextEvent.title + " · " + (nextEvent.date | shortDate)) if nextEvent else "",
  "/notices/": (newCount + " new this week") if newCount else "",
  "/living-here/roads/": roadParts | join(" · ") if roadParts | length else "No works listed",
  "/bins/": binLines
} -%}
<main class="container">
  {% include "home-skyline.njk" %}
  <section class="intro">
    <p class="intro-head">What's happening in Harvington, Norton and Lenchwick</p>
    <p class="intro-news">Get it all by email, free, every Thursday morning: <a href="{{ '/newsletter/' | url }}">join the newsletter</a>.</p>
    <p class="muted">We gather it from village groups, the parish council and neighbours, and check it as carefully as we can.</p>
  </section>
  {#- Welcome note (wording approved by Jon 17 Nov 2026), full width above the cards; stays until Jon asks for it to go. -#}
  <style>.home-welcome{margin:0 0 .75rem}.home-welcome .card{margin:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--accent)}.home-welcome h2{margin:0 0 .4rem;font-size:1.15rem}.home-welcome p{margin:0 0 .6rem;font-size:.95rem}.home-welcome p:last-child{margin:0}</style>
  <section class="home-welcome">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Welcome to the new Harvington website</h2>
      <p>This is a brand-new community website for Harvington, Norton and Lenchwick.</p>
      <p>Please help it grow. <a href="{{ '/newsletter/' | url }}">Join the free Thursday newsletter</a>, tell friends and neighbours about it, and use the <strong>Suggest an update</strong> button at the bottom of most pages to tell us what's wrong or missing.</p>
      <p>Got an event, some news or a message for the villages? Email it to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-cards">
    {% set signupCard = true %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}{% set signupCard = false %}
  </section>
  {% if site.facebookGroup %}<section class="home-section home-fb">
    <div class="card fb-card">
      <svg class="fb-logo" viewBox="0 0 36 36" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="18" fill="#0866FF"/><path fill="#fff" d="M20.2 36V24.4h3.9l.6-4.6h-4.5v-2.9c0-1.3.4-2.2 2.3-2.2h2.4V10.6c-.4-.1-1.8-.2-3.5-.2-3.5 0-5.8 2.1-5.8 6v3.4h-3.9v4.6h3.9V36z"/></svg>
      <div>
        <h2>Harvington's community Facebook group</h2>
        <p>For quick questions, lost pets, recommendations and the day-to-day goings-on, many villagers use the {{ site.facebookGroup.name }} group on Facebook. It's run by local volunteers, not by us.</p>
        <p class="mb0"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ site.facebookGroup.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go to the group on Facebook</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>{% endif %}
  <section id="living-here" class="home-section">
    <h2>Living here</h2>
    <p class="muted">{{ livinghere.intro }}</p>
    {% set cards = livinghere.cards %}{% set cardHeading = "h3" %}{% include "hub-cards.njk" %}
  </section>

  {#- Feedback form near the foot of the page, as on the Lenches Home (base.njk leaves it off "/"). -#}
  <div class="home-feedback" data-pagefind-ignore>{% include "feedback.njk" %}</div>
</main>

{% include "home-bins-script.njk" %}
